{"unit_id":"BPTumbleweed__dsh-session-retitle#feature-1","repo":"BPTumbleweed/dsh-session-retitle","commit":"0d01650904d9ebb2e5bbb7a1b04a228d3d8d9716","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-retitle 的功能「按对话自动起名」：用户在会话头部打开重命名操作并留空标题时，插件整理当前会话中的用户消息和助手回复，调用选定模型生成短标题，再交给 DSH 会话标题服务保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:263-270","lib/retitle.js:101-151","lib/index.js:171-178","lib/index.js:234-239"]}
{"unit_id":"BPTumbleweed__dsh-session-retitle#feature-2","repo":"BPTumbleweed/dsh-session-retitle","commit":"0d01650904d9ebb2e5bbb7a1b04a228d3d8d9716","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-retitle 的功能「手动设置会话名」：用户可在会话头部的重命名界面提交自定义标题；插件清理并限制标题长度，然后通过 DSH 会话标题服务更新当前会话名称。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:263-270","lib/index.js:102-105","lib/retitle.js:237-256","lib/index.js:234-239"]}
{"unit_id":"BPTumbleweed__dsh-session-retitle#caveat-1","repo":"BPTumbleweed/dsh-session-retitle","commit":"0d01650904d9ebb2e5bbb7a1b04a228d3d8d9716","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-retitle 使用前须知：自动起标题时，会话中的用户消息和助手回复摘要会作为模型请求内容发送给当前选用的模型服务；请按该模型服务的配置和数据处理方式使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/retitle.js:101-151","lib/retitle.js:181-195","lib/index.js:171-178"]}
